<title>USA: DeKalb knows no reason for stock drop.</title>
<headline>DeKalb knows no reason for stock drop.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>DeKalb Genetics Corp said Monday it knew of no reason for a drop in its stock price today.</p>
<p>&quot;We don't know of any reason,&quot; Jim Badger, communications manager, told Reuters.</p>
<p>DeKalb shares were off 4-11/16 at 56-5/16 with about 27,500 shares traded.</p>
<p>DeKalb is an agricultural company.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
